  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;這個我的世界地圖向下挖掘至基岩層，並設有一座巨大的信標！信標的真正用途有待玩家自行發掘。這座信標高達驚人的 318 格鑽石方塊！歡迎在這張地圖中自由遊玩，做任何你想做的事，或許你可以前往包含巨大信標的深坑世界邊緣一探究竟。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2cce048c-e1b7-42d9-ab4b-4451b1531ec6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"847\" height=\"454\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;video style=&quot;width: 219px; height: 438px;&quot; poster=&quot;&quot; controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;219&quot; height=&quot;438&quot;&gt; &lt;source src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/shorts/zfeoZkZinI8&quot;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">願主保佑你，&nbsp;玩得愉快 :)</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1218403/description_4a0c0c9d-0d30-4eab-aa14-a3beb58d2597.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"191\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">支持我！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a href=\"coff.ee/danielboonemc\" rel=\"nofollow\">coff.ee/danielboonemc</a></span><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>也歡迎瀏覽我的其他地圖！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/forest-and-fields-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">森林與田野</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七座生存島嶼</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘島嶼</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/pale-sky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蒼白天空島</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/boones-sky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">布恩的天空島</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/deserts-and-mountains-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沙漠與山脈冒險地圖</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>J.M.J.</strong></span></p>",
